    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Respiratory distress in newborn babies can be effectively treated if caught early. With this in mind, Nurse Instructors from AKU's secondary hospitals collaborated with the CIME team to design an activity that focused on identifying and initiating treatment for respiratory distress.",
